### Day 9 - JWT Authentication Tests
### Run the app first:
### Base URL: 

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Check - public endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info

### Documentation - public endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs

#### 2. Try to access assets without token - should return 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets

### 3. Register a regular user - should return token with role USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Normal User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

### 4. Login as regular user - should return token with role USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

### 5. Get assets with user token - should return 200 OK
### Replace PLACE_WITH_USER_TOKEN with token received from login/register response 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpc3MiOiJhc3NldC10cmFja2VyIiwibmFtZSI6Ik5vcm1hbCBVc2VyIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg1NTYyNDc3LCJpYXQiOjE3ODU1NTg4NzcsInVzZXJJZCI6IjZhNmFhZmRmZGJiZGRmZmVhYjc0NTQxZiJ9.2gl1ftfpmT5ZsZ4p3MFbqAgKBjeH3-HInB_L1arki-k

